{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARE YOU UP TO THE CHALLENGE?</strong></h2>Murderous Muses is an old-school FMV adventure that rewards patience, exploration and puzzle solving. It\u2019s not an interactive movie game but it does have over 3 hours of FMV!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO KILLED MORDECHAI GREY?</strong></h2>Play as the gallery\u2019s night watch and explore its secrets over three days, watching paintings spring to life fuelled by \u2018Eyes of Mordechai\u2019 - a scarce resource that makes you ask questions wisely.<br><br>A year has passed since the unsolved murder of Mordechai Grey and in tribute, Gallery Argenta is about to exhibit six of the artist\u2019s most famous portraits and prime suspects - the \u2018Murderous Muses\u2019. Question suspects, unlock police interviews, and finally deduce who\u2019s the murderous muse!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve a murder mystery that re-rolls every time you play<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727270/extras/70155722666a29ed702297234e4f8988.poster.avif?t=1762428222\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727270/extras/70155722666a29ed702297234e4f8988.webm?t=1762428222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727270/extras/70155722666a29ed702297234e4f8988.mp4?t=1762428222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Explore a procedurally-generated gallery and share seeds with friends<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727270/extras/2160598aeb1afd45f80e34ce36a2c32f.poster.avif?t=1762428222\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727270/extras/2160598aeb1afd45f80e34ce36a2c32f.webm?t=1762428222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727270/extras/2160598aeb1afd45f80e34ce36a2c32f.mp4?t=1762428222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Puzzles unlock bonus treasure rooms<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727270/extras/25cae4ce7be64a18d232a842fafac8a3.poster.avif?t=1762428222\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727270/extras/25cae4ce7be64a18d232a842fafac8a3.webm?t=1762428222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727270/extras/25cae4ce7be64a18d232a842fafac8a3.mp4?t=1762428222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>A persistent \u2018trophy room\u2019 to store collectibles<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727270/extras/cbb0e9bc80c3084e305a82cc1fd69911.poster.avif?t=1762428222\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727270/extras/cbb0e9bc80c3084e305a82cc1fd69911.webm?t=1762428222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727270/extras/cbb0e9bc80c3084e305a82cc1fd69911.mp4?t=1762428222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>A rich new story setting, Mirlhaven island<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727270/extras/e2e23f3f8842f5cd1f3c71231707aa7d.poster.avif?t=1762428222\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https: